#. A doofy little Gold Hatchling.    It matures into an adult Hatch morph, the <link="HATCHGOLD">Gold Hatch</link>, which loves nibbling on various metals.
msgctxt "GoldHatch.STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.DESC"
msgid "A doofy little Gold Hatchling.\n\nIt matures into an adult Hatch morph, the <link=\"HATCHGOLD\">Gold Hatch</link>, which loves nibbling on various metals."
msgstr "一只呆头呆脑的小金哈奇。\n\n它成年后会变成<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">金哈奇</link>，喜欢啃食各种金属。"

#. <link="HATCHGOLD">Gold Hatchling</link>
msgctxt "GoldHatch.STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_GOLD.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">Gold Hatchling</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">黄金哈奇幼体</link>"

#. Gold Hatches excrete solid <link="GOLD">Gold</link> as waste and enjoy burrowing into the ground.
msgctxt "GoldHatch.STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_GOLD.DESC"
msgid "Gold Hatches excrete solid <link=\"GOLD\">Gold</link> as waste and enjoy burrowing into the ground."
msgstr "金色哈奇会排泄固体<link=\"GOLD\">金</link>作为废物，并且喜欢钻入地下。"

#. <link="HATCHGOLD">Gold Hatchling Egg</link>
msgctxt "GoldHatch.STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_GOLD.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">Gold Hatchling Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">黄金哈奇蛋</link>"

#. <link="HATCHGOLD">Gold Hatch</link>
msgctxt "GoldHatch.STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_GOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">Gold Hatch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHGOLD\">黄金哈奇</link>"
